<title>USA: Video Update expands board to seven.</title>
<headline>Video Update expands board to seven.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Update Inc, an international video chain, said Wednesday it elected Bernard Patriacca to its board, increasing the size to seven members.</p>
<p>Patriacca, who has served in various capacities at Dunkin' Donuts Inc, including chief financial officer, was elected to Video Update's board on April 1.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
